<title>UK: Eurotunnel's Morton to retire in October.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel's Morton to retire in October.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alastair Morton, co-chairman of channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc, said he will retire around the end of October.</p>
<p>Morton, in a &quot;personal postscript&quot; to the co-chairmen's statement accompanying the company's interim results, said he believes his job is done.</p>
<p>Morton has always said he would not leave Eurotunnel until the company has restructured its huge bank debt of over eight billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
